/P 282 0 R
/E (In order to host a fun and enriching hackathon, we need to provide hackers with everything they need to perform their tasks and have an enjoyable experience. From digital tools and equipment to prizes, snacks, and entertainment, hackathons are quite expensive and that is why we need your help! All funds and contributions are directly invested in MariHacks itself to make our event the most memorable possible!)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
